<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results</p>
<p>on the first day of the Gold Coast Classic women's tennis</p>
<p>tournament at Hope Island on Monday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Rachel McQuillan (Australia) beat Wang Shi-ting (Taipei) 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Rita Grande (Italy) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>3-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina) 6-1</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>6-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Nana Miyagi (Japan) 5-7 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Annabel Ellwood (Australia) beat Sabine Hack (Germany) 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
